WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.874
Brad: Be careful, be careful!

2
00:00:04.875 --> 00:00:06.405
Danny: What's the matter?

3
00:00:06.406 --> 00:00:10.137
Brad: You might be stepping on someone!

4
00:00:10.138 --> 00:00:11.978
Danny: What's that?

5
00:00:11.979 --> 00:00:14.977
