10
00:00:26.093 --> 00:00:29.535
Danny: Oh, well. I guess we should give up.

11
00:00:29.536 --> 00:00:33.754
Brad: No. Let's see what we can find to fix it.

12
00:00:33.755 --> 00:00:36.127
Danny: Fine.

13
00:00:36.128 --> 00:00:37.897
Brad: Here's some old

14
00:00:37.898 --> 00:00:39.389
gum. Danny:

15
