36
00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:50.673
Danny: Let's go home!

37
00:01:50.674 --> 00:01:52.149
Brad: We can't go.

38
00:01:52.150 --> 00:01:56.279
You agreed we would restore Chuck and Dave to normal size.

39
00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:57.983
Danny: I guess so.

40
00:01:57.984 --> 00:02:05.173
Brad: Good. Now, I just have to add this silver wrapper.

41
00:02:05.174 --> 00:02:07.219
Danny: Use your imagination.

42
00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:09.419
That's what works for me.

43
00:02:09.421 --> 00:02:17.113
Brad: Good idea. Big, big, big.

44
00:02:17.114 --> 00:02:21.185
Danny: I guess your imagination isn't very good.

45
00:02:21.186 --> 00:02:24.120
Brad: It appears that it isn't.

46
00:02:24.121 --> 00:02:28.162
Danny: Now do you agree that there's nothing we can do?

47
00:02:28.163 --> 00:02:31.640
Brad: No. You just told me what will make it work.

48
00:02:31.641 --> 00:02:33.084
Danny: What?

49
00:02:33.085 --> 00:02:37.182
Brad: Your imagination!

